    "text": "(i) <math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> (for <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> to be defined)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />i.e.&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />(ii) <math><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />(iii) <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8713;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant